# ==============================
# ABOUT
# ==============================

msgid "about_title"
msgstr "X-Ray Plugin"

msgid "about_text"
msgstr ""
"X-Ray Plugin\n"
"═══════════════════════════════\n"
"\n"
"Overview\n"
"Bring AI-powered reading experience to your ebooks!\n"
"Similar to Amazon Kindle X-Ray, intelligently extract\n"
"characters, locations, timelines, historical context,\n"
"and more, with spoiler-free progressive analysis.\n"
"\n"
"═══════════════════════════════\n"
"\n"
" Cloud Sync\n"
"• WebDAV/Dropbox support\n"
"• Auto upload/download X-Ray data\n"
"• Seamless multi-device sync\n"
"• Preserves progressive analysis progress\n"
"\n"
" Progressive Analysis\n"
"• Segment analysis by reading progress\n"
"• Spoiler-free experience\n"
"• Auto-load best cache\n"
"\n"
" Progress-Aware\n"
"• Display reading vs analysis progress\n"
"• X-Ray only analyzes up to current page\n"
"\n"
"═══════════════════════════════\n"
"\n"
"Full Features:\n"
"\n"
" AI Integration\n"
"• Google Gemini\n"
"• ChatGPT\n"
"\n"
" Character Management\n"
"• AI auto-extract character info\n"
"• Detailed profiles (role/gender/occupation)\n"
"• Smart search with fuzzy matching\n"
"• Real-time chapter characters display\n"
"• Personal notes system\n"
"\n"
" Timeline\n"
"• Key events in chronological order\n"
"• Event-character associations\n"
"• Chapter locations\n"
"\n"
" Historical Figures\n"
"• Detect real historical figures\n"
"• Biographies and era info\n"
"• Book context and importance\n"
"• Direct/indirect reference detection\n"
"\n"
" Locations & Themes\n"
"• Important locations with descriptions\n"
"• Main themes extraction\n"
"• Spoiler-free summaries\n"
"• Author info\n"
"\n"
" Smart Caching\n"
"• Progressive cache (xx%.json)\n"
"• Permanent, offline-available\n"
"• Auto-select best cache\n"
"• Per-book storage\n"
"\n"
"═══════════════════════════════\n"
"\n"
"Quick Start:\n"
"\n"
"1. Configure API\n"
"Menu → X-Ray → AI Settings\n"
"→ Google Gemini API Key\n"
"(Free signup: makersuite.google.com)\n"
"\n"
"2. Choose analysis mode\n"
"Menu → X-Ray → Fetch AI Data\n"
"• Spoiler-free mode: Up to current page\n"
"• Full mode: Entire book\n"
"\n"
"3. (Optional) Configure cloud sync\n"
"Menu → X-Ray → Cloud Sync\n"
"→ Manage Server\n"
"→ Setup WebDAV/Dropbox\n"
"\n"
"4. Start exploring!\n"
"• Characters: All character profiles\n"
"• Chapter Characters: Current chapter\n"
"• Timeline: Event tracking\n"
"• Historical Figures: Real figures\n"
"\n"
"═══════════════════════════════\n"
"\n"
"Tips:\n"
"\n"
"• Use spoiler-free mode first, avoid spoilers\n"
"• Switch to full mode after finishing\n"
"• Cloud sync preserves all progressive caches\n"
"• Gemini Flash Lite is fastest and free\n"
"• Cache is permanent, no need to re-fetch\n"
"\n"
"═══════════════════════════════\n"
"\n"
"FAQ:\n"
"\n"
"Q: How to avoid spoilers?\n"
"A: Choose \"Up to current page\" mode, AI only\n"
"analyzes content you've already read.\n"
"\n"
"Q: How does progressive cache work?\n"
"A: Auto-segments analysis results, next load\n"
"picks the version closest to your progress.\n"
"\n"
"Q: What services does cloud sync support?\n"
"A: WebDAV and Dropbox. Any WebDAV service\n"
"like Nutstore can be used.\n"
"\n"
"Q: Are API keys free?\n"
"A: Gemini API has generous free quota,\n"
"most users don't need to pay.\n"
"\n"
"Q: How to clear cache?\n"
"A: Menu → X-Ray → Clear Cache\n"
"Deletes main cache and all progressive caches.\n"
"\n"
"═══════════════════════════════\n"
"\n"
"Technical Info:\n"
"\n"
"Cache location:\n"
"<book>.sdr/xray_cache.lua (main cache)\n"
"<book>.sdr/xray_analysis/XX%.json (progressive)\n"
"\n"
"Settings location:\n"
"~/.config/koreader/settings/xray/\n"
"\n"
"═══════════════════════════════\n"
"\n"
"Happy reading! 📖✨"

